  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340305dde03420bdc86a9be6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终于在最佳时机夺下了梦寐以求的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46a6f32ade34ef127ee5d09d43dc9a082c787c66aa220cfe16afdcf6b703621c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f2e70d906b9b64cd4406964",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以<bashin>漂亮地称霸了战况激烈的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70111cf33528bb8e3435b2c9929fbbb2dc1eee1700fbc877be42a1907078aa5a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c44da07839b76dbf90bddb6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "近期的不佳状态宛如从来不存在似地，以<bashin>压制对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a95a468f1e8d4bf0a09d648beb6152de287d777c900e7a9ca81606d312eb9568",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da0e5a827683775699bc7acf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以利落的领头之姿，从头到尾称霸竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a94b6407f63bbfe4db511b1ad8c9523b7652557609df960588c7ed1236f7f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6978301f418f1dc04167b6bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于前列以稳健的表现顺利地击败了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6813197caedf1ab36fb6fa4ad98f2eecefd47f4f5f2e41217898ee282f3bf29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa31350af4339dced7229551",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充分发挥速度，以精彩的居中支配了竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e160aa9cc09562fe9f1aacd9edd1ced625d25884c6e63e17f4e6786bf9a0820",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d0584fc01cba71dd9d55484",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以漂亮的后追，一个一个地超越了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e42e39105bf0d3ed3e523007703e09fe05d02600291575d2f943a40d039741",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a08f6da65f4e1e5cab443807",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "值得将她视为大赛中需瞩目的赛马娘来持续关注。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e21076abefe3dc59a1509d0f764e709a7c025ea8fcc18aaa04fed4e1ab320ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38917ad1b914dfed8d7b2f57",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "既然展现了这样的表现，之后应该也十分令人期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79511ea7b1e46ceca29481f273da9eab36e6f415f3984ca24afac64364cb4521",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24449f1f5372778a00aadd55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好，非常期待今后的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fbab5d144f6330e4d7a02dd38d05b40411b6fcae62c063199914c70d67fee6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c529f334663d12f4fa440d4f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "状态转好，可以期待接下来一路过关斩将吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7ad71681cba8405786616bf3df5c581e61978574e259f398d9e478d7b5c0fb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6fc0a87ce517c3421606b8b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "极度欢腾的第2轮。<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>拿下第1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d62b6c0555a69879cfc73ae28ef2fc250469a87d006c2e800c5d5984bcb6cf4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d2ad1e79f26026cb9962e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>以<bashin>称霸了竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5f5b0aa3715fd7d2636a0c5fbb25d9e5135c961fe7001c7c0d2411745414002",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ef7354c9587e9e8c5eaf695",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在菁英齐聚的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛中，<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>以<bashin>获胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01ae0469f3054a13df6be33b69f06e804e80aa62a04cdd7e86cc3bf7680dd1eb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:243c691bf515edf26f99a421",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然前阵子有输有赢，但这次展露出精彩的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bb479da7711702e8c93c176c795371332d003651759151dddc3ab9616713393",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61f8faa093de87647ef6326d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "果然当这名赛马娘进入她擅长的状况后，就能战线压倒性的跑姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fe74cbd87657a863b3995bb1fe0d63dbed12c44884ebd0873259a239290f8f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9277d86dda89ce1a05fd6f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那发自内心享受竞赛的态度和跑法，为其带来良好的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7beb0f047732cf20968ff7a24d335f0849c2d4e2320d7522116dd2da0bdf822e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6893841ee4ea37032f95e248",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完美贯彻身为『王牌』的职责，实在了不起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f01ccf6c02138dadc2d230207cbb1b62aae596c7e56694d9c6be29299455a853",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1ed9881a002a8ef9efa2af0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以利落的领头之姿，从头到尾称霸竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a94b6407f63bbfe4db511b1ad8c9523b7652557609df960588c7ed1236f7f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86a1be8e8ff429363f0d074e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于前列以稳健的表现顺利地击败了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6813197caedf1ab36fb6fa4ad98f2eecefd47f4f5f2e41217898ee282f3bf29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aff2a928cca9a1837b84c6ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充分发挥速度，以精彩的居中支配了竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e160aa9cc09562fe9f1aacd9edd1ced625d25884c6e63e17f4e6786bf9a0820",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1801dbbe5ef19af4b4af38",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以漂亮的后追，一个一个地超越了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e42e39105bf0d3ed3e523007703e09fe05d02600291575d2f943a40d039741",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:999a00306a9f14771cf98a65",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该有很多观众会成为她的新粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49a8b27dfa607379dc3e6332efb2cb6df6a2d0138e6acdc82e5255d20cdc54cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f104f59f4097f2345854edd7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "沐浴在聚光灯下的她，表现能更上一层楼吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2bcf5706fc364b49190597b790acca71c6b603db8ae2f1627271cf7d6b9b341",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49f1fc3785ca8aa7993cce95",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想必她在下次的竞赛也会以精彩的表现让我们为之狂热吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4856596391c19da8a9e8099e593deba0043ba4671e4869c8b81920385288b0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd193f5aeb62530612138b10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在重要的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 一战中获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49191235593facbb36e0a6c8fcee7b8e2486d52e3d08164590c5b8eb78bd51d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07ea73f13c31c20d2c2df48d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在欢欣鼓舞的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛中，由<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>拿下第1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e32eacae674a03ad805b8c4f093315d251e40e5cc2f8eae7fff3c6b2ee4b4b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:217120aefa68af89bec9df0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，在大批观众注目下获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a745f3887d864aebbd193e5bb7b7c2a2169bdc270656bbaba9670e749c0b163c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f7007f99a33af7244a03342",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以近期5战2胜的战绩获得注目的赛马娘果然实力坚强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19f2fe9a1de71570090ce8660dd2ab9485c6c8c41cf7466e91592e79b4083f9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49692ae3a24bbfced9101abf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她不愧深具实力，即使与强敌并列也能有出类拔萃的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66935e8d4d0f29f9d2ac0f823dc84defae2bed4cf670baaf64dbe2fc7d6bafd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63fec6396e6a7da1e8c3fca0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她展现了不论对手是谁、不论战场在何处都能发挥实力的稳定性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6434271ef7d1bfc6a838a2c7e995ec115b7881cde7a3e59e607c57968de6bcb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79fbd7eb193e5deb20a3e8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够彻底在<bashin>的交战中胜出的实力无须质疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ea88a7bfd997a96c49b66dddc8d6d1c585691267a9debe1e066cafd579d568f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b641a1cb45899c104463f092",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她在参赛者净是强豪的竞赛中，竟然以<bashin>胜出了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b940cb9503cb3e58f66ada4a317e1ce317249c100a389e7d5aa064f2fab95230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e4c6baad891a724c5de2c34",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "作为<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>的王牌漂亮地打赢了一场硬仗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89a68c044d528d572038f01a5df347ab086e9912fcdaea14f2ed039868026f8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a0bd668ea7708f942fa4d6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以利落的领头之姿，从头到尾称霸竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a94b6407f63bbfe4db511b1ad8c9523b7652557609df960588c7ed1236f7f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
